  "result": "Excellent! All 58 tests pass (including 14 new tests for numbering and issuing). Here's what I've added:\n\n**New module `src/numbering.js`:**\n\n`nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)` \u2014 Generates the next invoice number:\n- Format: `INV-<year>-<counter>` (e.g., `INV-2026-0005`)\n- Counter has 4 digits, zero-padded\n- Starts at 0001 and resets every year\n- Handles numbers in any order and skips malformed entries\n\n**New function in `src/invoices.js`:**\n\n`issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)` \u2014 Issues a draft invoice:\n- Sets the invoice `number` using `nextInvoiceNumber`\n- Changes `status` from 'draft' to 'issued'\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if invoice isn't in draft status\n- Preserves all other invoice data (customerId, issueDate, lines)\n- Returns new invoice without mutating the original\n\n**Tests added:**\n\n- **8 numbering tests**: empty numbers, new year restart, increment from highest, different years, unordered numbers, zero-padding, malformed entries\n- **6 issuing tests**: set number and status, increment from existing, different years, NOT_DRAFT validation, immutability, data preservation\n\nThe implementation correctly handles year-based counter resetting and ignores malformed invoice numbers gracefully.",
